Description: 4k intro by Faemiyah, released at Assembly 2011
 Dirty Garden is a 4 kilobyte intro by the Finnish demogroup Faemiyah,
 rendering ray-marched fractals (Mandelbulb and Julia sets) with a
 software synthesizer soundtrack.
 .
 Release: Assembly 2011 4k intro compo, 8th place
 Release platform: FreeBSD-ia32
 Ports: FreeBSD, Linux, Windows
 Authors: Juippi, Trilkk, Warma
